  "lessonId": "08",
  "title": "二分查找下标",
  "description": "第一行输入升序整数列表，第二行输入目标值。输出目标值的下标（从 0 开始）；不存在输出 -1。",
  "testCases": [
    {
      "input": "1 3 5 7 9\n5\n",
      "expected": "2"
    },
    {
      "input": "1 3 5 7 9\n4\n",
      "expected": "-1"
    },
    {
      "input": "2 4 6\n2\n",
      "expected": "0"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "while left <= right，mid = (left+right)//2",
    "不能用 list.index()，必须用二分"
  ]
}